D	0755	recursive-custom-rule-providers-actions/rules
F	0644	28	d3db178d6c0d8b9fd537f38eea7d51a575ff4229a27a027e51df4753d2765897	recursive-custom-rule-providers-actions/rules/BUILD.bazel
